# Figma MCP (rate-limit aware)

Free plan = 6 read API calls/month. Two servers configured to optimize usage:

| Action | Server | Tools | Rate limit |
|--------|--------|-------|------------|
| **Read design** (layout, styles, nodes) | `figma-cached` | `get_figma_data`, `download_figma_images` | Cached 30 days. First call = 1 quota, subsequent = 0 |
| **Write/Generate** (create design, code connect) | `figma` (official) | `generate_figma_design`, `use_figma`, `add_code_connect_map`, `whoami` | FREE, no rate limit |

Rules:
- ALWAYS use `figma-cached` for reading design data — NEVER use `figma` official for reads
- Use `figma` official only for write operations (generate_design, use_figma, code_connect)
- When user pastes a Figma URL, extract fileKey and nodeId, then call `figma-cached` > `get_figma_data`

